{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01731","headline":"杂曲歌辞 游子吟 · 李益","name":"杂曲歌辞 游子吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"女羞夫壻荡，客耻主人贱。\n遭遇同衆流，低回愧相见。\n君非青铜镜，何事空照面？\n莫以衣上尘，不谓心如练。\n人生当荣盛，待士勿言倦。\n君看白日驰，何异弦上箭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}